<title>THAILAND: Bangchak Petroleum 1996 net profit up.</title>
<headline>Bangchak Petroleum 1996 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			    Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		1.96	vs	     1.67</p>
<p>    Net		   1,023.59	vs	   870.68</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Bangchak Petroleum Plc, an energy firm which runs a refinery here.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
